{"3271530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker", "steam_appid": 3271530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/26a6a483a95b495f61e61dd11018eb23.avif?t=1751368747\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras_big/26a6a483a95b495f61e61dd11018eb23.avif?t=1751368747 width=800 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍿 Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker 🍿</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the tastiest clicker game around! Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker is all about turning tiny kernels into a mountain of delicious, profitable popcorn, one satisfying pop at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Pop 'til you drop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop kernels into the pan and watch the magic happen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your popped treasures for cold, hard cash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your popping game to churn out popcorn faster than ever!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰 Chase that golden dream:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the endorphins when you hear the jingle of the rarer golden popcorn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned cash on shiny new pans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch up your popping scenery with unlockable skies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎵 Unwind and relax:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the satisfying pop-pop-pop soothe your stress away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a calm, pressure-free gaming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for unwinding after a long day or during short breaks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏅 Pop and achieve at your pace:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of in-game and Steam achievements to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with a variety of popcorn-popping goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush, no pressure - just <i>pure</i> popcorn fun at your own pace, accompanied by some soothing jazzy tunes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker is your cosy corner in the gaming world. It's a small, fun game that's always satisfying to play, whether you've got five minutes or five hours. Let the rhythmic popping and gentle gameplay wash away your worries, and why not grab a bag of Popcorn to munch on as you play, because you deserve it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take it easy, and get popping!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/92490275205db0933d63761215c7ce23.poster.avif?t=1751368747\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/92490275205db0933d63761215c7ce23.webm?t=1751368747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/26a6a483a95b495f61e61dd11018eb23.avif?t=1751368747\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras_big/26a6a483a95b495f61e61dd11018eb23.avif?t=1751368747 width=800 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍿 Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker 🍿</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the tastiest clicker game around! Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker is all about turning tiny kernels into a mountain of delicious, profitable popcorn, one satisfying pop at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Pop 'til you drop:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop kernels into the pan and watch the magic happen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your popped treasures for cold, hard cash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your popping game to churn out popcorn faster than ever!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💰 Chase that golden dream:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the endorphins when you hear the jingle of the rarer golden popcorn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned cash on shiny new pans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch up your popping scenery with unlockable skies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎵 Unwind and relax:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the satisfying pop-pop-pop soothe your stress away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a calm, pressure-free gaming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for unwinding after a long day or during short breaks</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏅 Pop and achieve at your pace:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of in-game and Steam achievements to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself with a variety of popcorn-popping goals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rush, no pressure - just <i>pure</i> popcorn fun at your own pace, accompanied by some soothing jazzy tunes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker is your cosy corner in the gaming world. It's a small, fun game that's always satisfying to play, whether you've got five minutes or five hours. Let the rhythmic popping and gentle gameplay wash away your worries, and why not grab a bag of Popcorn to munch on as you play, because you deserve it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Take it easy, and get popping!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/92490275205db0933d63761215c7ce23.poster.avif?t=1751368747\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/extras/92490275205db0933d63761215c7ce23.webm?t=1751368747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "🍿Addictive Popcorn clicker! 🍿A game that makes you feel good. Drop, Pop, and watch your wealth rise, while listening to an assortment of Cool Jazz. Unlock lots of achievements, new Pans, Skies and Upgrades. Try not to get addicted to Golden Popcorn! How much can you Pop?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/header.jpg?t=1751368747", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/64d5212218dcb3bc4b8b491fa95c3c62c741235d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751368747", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/64d5212218dcb3bc4b8b491fa95c3c62c741235d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751368747", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any mid range +<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any mid range +<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jolly Dumpling"], "publishers": ["Jolly Dumpling"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 599, "final": 599, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.99"}, "packages": [1159103], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1159103, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Pop the Corn: Kernel Clicker - $5.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 599}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/ss_a6a271b5603ec22809553a5e353b4be49bca3fa4.600x338.jpg?t=1751368747", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271530/ss_a6a271b5603ec22809553a5e353b4be49bca3fa4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1751368747"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto